        "teaser": "Fog clings to the stone of St. Jude’s of the Mist. At the Low Crossing, merchants trade coin for safety amidst the mud and the iron wheels of the market. Barliman keeps the Rusty Spoke Inn, a drafty tavern where the floors never dry. He watches the travelers pass through the grey shroud of the North Gate Station, guarding a road that demands a heavy price for passage. Amidst the scent of dried herbs and heavy bread, secrets weigh as much as the ale. In a world of quick hands and whispered lies, how much is a man’s soul worth at the crossroads?"
